{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1478,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596b9ceb44c9b85185bc8908",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d18f79da33c356a433357d86ef63d6f12d0393bf7a401aa168fbc536b2b3d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b376a64590f6283b33597d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢你那双过于坚定的眼睛。\r\n我们都一样固执己见，\r\n好好相处吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "803dfb7cec0166ed5b5d3c18844a75d8b3ea3086e1814cd6595d8e838adb228e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29818f57fec6c21d5adfa272",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去巡视一下田里的状况啊？\r\n嘿嘿，已经完全养成习惯了呢。\r\n……谢谢你啦，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c14787e2e0a9da19b3487971bce2b0ac97de292b95e52550d7b2cf46b977e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43fa1da596fddfd0a244053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！所以我们来放风筝吧。\r\n我这「葛城王牌」四个字\r\n可是写得相得不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5582a7471429c7cbd5be95b3a838c098a192a6fc8cf9ae5765bb955e163ad75e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e72a8271a1c2f7626bcf657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶上了……！准备回礼巧克力真是\r\n忙死我了！我准备了上百份……\r\n一定够我当场回礼给所有人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a548d2683b7fc68d7db8687e125705d670b1a5f72ecec94a291c6bf0ac49297",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bcca5c24a34712150a91e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人情……不对，朋友……也不对……\r\n真……心……啊啊──麻烦死了！\r\n我等一下会把同志巧克力送你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b278dca5af4483ad79da27b931716da9568ebc5104eec32a9bc017f6170e4880",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c00d11b7d8632b4efb348ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竹子装饰完就丢掉，感觉好浪费啊。\r\n这样吧，我去拿柴刀！待会我们一起\r\n来吃流水素面！好好期待一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "750d58b3644219f9a52e5341c61c0b0e91a1b6fce003b7fd48eed7370f216fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfaa9543d75b635a48a631b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈，我劝你还是别捣蛋哦～？\r\n很可惜，我早就准备好点心了！\r\n这些柿饼的滋味可甜了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e2c49bc0bfe8cea33fe3745e126e8bf588574a02e381f2b41d54729ce0a582e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d70299e69f5635b0414a005d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到圣诞节就想到日式炸鸡块！\r\n事先用大量酱油腌好的鸡肉\r\n已经在冰箱里等着我啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e87674f48578357c58df29baa44774a851b061902712b7df0f7b999a710e1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66aa968aea6e67c24a62cdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不知道要送什么礼物才会让\r\n训练员开心，所以直接告诉我吧？\r\n王牌圣诞老公公会实现你的愿望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61ead8470b7d38b21646257c698a51289398820b1f7d25620f1fbb7cd79a9259",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5254fdc406335b2f43f881f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！获胜啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e195efae49c3056f3858d6ac54d6477eb2ec2ece965bbf8a6bc5ff8d06b728c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a15083daeb224f9b80c5f08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也辛苦你啦。至少今天应该会\r\n休假吧？……给～我～休～息～哦？\r\n半夜我们还要去新年参拜耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ef2892827ed5f0e3251c9536d90504e10bde2518c92da381ad1a8a14dbbf8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a342a98ee3da0d4c4445db7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我买了耳机送你！这还是我第一次\r\n挑选人类用的耳机……但这款应该能\r\n恰到好处地消除噪音，帮助你专心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f034e3b1ca9ad28ff45e9da923d00f7012587f550613b69739283be72791420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf6386778d1ccc93fcbc79f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐……呃……\r\n啊──那个，虽然外表不太好看，\r\n但我做了个蛋糕……你要吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "759417e91c15a2c8171377b5ac91921e1c6681d29055b5dbdabe2648e9e79ec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:684d6c97f00c25da9bea5f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "死党说因为我生日，所以要为我\r\n办场派对耶！我已经事先去跑一跑，\r\n让胃空出来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f863e32b1a2ba399009705da91987af23fcaabaddc188c1f46a30f6485c43128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce2d1cb09c11dd5175fa3dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你问我想要什么礼物？\r\n一台专属的农用车吧！……呵，\r\n开玩笑的啦！一起吃美食吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dcd3b1d55412ffca8a2e6caa40c9cfd1c53dc71769376627303fe9cf3afe59f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d87d5456e3cf252d28bb7d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告哦。\r\n会是什么事呢？\r\n总之去看看就知道啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c524a774b8caeef67aaeacda001d829274d137cf2e85df2ad9b668454483fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2767b63f0069e1311a90a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到了礼物耶！\r\n太好啦，快去领取吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a568b268b2cf202d99435f43bf582ef822e1b48b992cca02624407fe4a2ab676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eceba2e6b45ef8982ab7a434",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完成任务了，辛苦啦！\r\n来，收下奖励吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2505b1e98e1e4e5eaafc89c375d81e417ecf89607747a05259fab4789f5a2256",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecd5267a2ca5967ef1fbe6a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像快要开始举办活动了耶？\r\n你有没有兴趣啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c296c9f88d67bd4be5e08030d2bd3039a6bb388d7a6dde467743ad66d50b61ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cb2fbe4e28c0c740858026d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎已经开始举办啰！\r\n好～就由我这个王牌来打头阵吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d94d51602faada80e6d319be0da34fc4e940efb3d2f2e8f30d265784b5dadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6e7d901e7e0d55a315b2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777b4ad8979359adb6db6b7ac3d8844f696089febbf4880ad99e25d4bcfb7c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d71fbf1c97223a360d1a2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f59bdf5907a37da4aec86aff55e8a43418b4cbd757c480f5786c04c5eead63c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1a2c26eb10d99cf5aceb8c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スカジャンってのはロマンでよ…\r\nサテンと和柄は伊達と硬派の象徴！\r\nトレーナーさんもそう思わねーか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02d89b658f85157fc8e8434a7667bb5145db94622c1b4e81e67b13740aae9ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eea1b5aed04c0019c7258c7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ着て田舎に帰ると、じいちゃん\r\nばあちゃんが遠くからでも声かけて\r\nくれんだ。手伝ってくれーってな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5421a32078485012c7c91a0f1fadc6071da2ba65a8efdd9d0201d80ff025d80e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be611820a77890aeade2998b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "じいちゃんちの敷地で、車の練習を\r\nしてたんだ。もう運転できるし、\r\nはやく普通免許も欲しいぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "857603bd4b54355c2ea23c383561e60c4551e47626406d0bf3514451ad96c42a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:323609440666e47bf949ea9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是平手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c12ac5317481cfc712db8f78b7550685943b2692c3ba858637f37c51a4d9bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f8887208c9b45df88e29e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好～来抛人庆祝啰──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa92e005699d572cc16fea183d35aeaa78efb7d0b8674baa12110524122a4d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3810c0382df8b5fb005424ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777b4ad8979359adb6db6b7ac3d8844f696089febbf4880ad99e25d4bcfb7c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2813264cb7292b37760bfaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是平手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c12ac5317481cfc712db8f78b7550685943b2692c3ba858637f37c51a4d9bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d605716f27b1901e91d871",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新高分纪录了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b815d8e925a03409f368372177a362f6285ed76f21c3e4bcd289c96d056acd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d5bc77ed50a9990210a4ae1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着王牌我一起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c0812ac62a91614f348bf23be5320cb696980a0d6539c2c41e11ad63e7065ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1951a1065be148c290868d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95c55f6d9da8b9f3d1d6aa54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特训啊！\r\n也让我加入吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95663a42af3d1531e393f729208480a43ee1ba56bd6433c467cd5372ae93d781",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:073323ca96c1d83fbe1b44e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦～我们彼此都\r\n经历了不少事情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7f9b35f5c362f32bcccb28dee0472e6a19bbca50ce8f05850735266f427b0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adbe5f9496bf70611f077bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要比赛了是吧！\r\n我已经准备得万无一失了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e143df3b5a65d660c47e5c430d0d184b7569ae5e3302178617ee0051a9860b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b678b67a0b6f6d8b35d3c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火热的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb5b09a660a936f41e954f49225c76ec7ff13f1bab93d70828fba44bf8b642b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83e9a59a94abe99d6fe8bc86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我们来当！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c64ae6fb11c2e434682781152d7a1c141b440fd03db21e532028eeac7281501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee4923da27543ace831824e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この背中を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc654b777cfb6b6bfefba93bb5e460611b8b24471610f43e9ecdb73165c93d33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:878a52ee2e18d76ec3abfd18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d16f9e85fa7e8122fee073ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涌现出一股惊人的力量……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dfefdcc60b7b38ba59a24250449e2f62929e7a7b303d137ac175d0a270ccce3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a593c08639de5a70b7dcd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦！\r\n这是今天的登录奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "883fe464cd82bd04bc5c24d7382e5671f4c9bbf4b64add3c04e59821e98010e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df442da53456a86037e92771",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好～那就拜托你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9bb4a645ec96c66a173a8fe78f064419277f1ff8c915afe091c4591d4afd6ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06816a0e6ce6b9b03edef698",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊，得手了！",
